"""Verified generator for the Antichain on Trees construction in arXiv:1705.01240.

Section 3 and Appendix Lemma 3 reduce k-Multicolored Clique to the paper's
new Antichain on Trees (ACT) problem.  This module samples the multicolored
clique first, hides it in regular bipartite compatibility graphs, and exposes
the resulting ACT instance using the paper's exact Start/Choose/Cover gadgets.

The submitted witness is the paper's compact set of one chosen graph vertex
per colour.  ``verify`` expands it into every ACT placement and checks finite
cost, the weight bound, node uniqueness, and root/child incomparability.  It
does not consult the planted answer.
"""

